    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "coach_paldea_top_sp01_00",
      "hash64": "B5926AF1B0B480DD",
      "text": "Ich werde dir ein wenig Gesellschaft leisten,\\nauch wenn ich leider nicht lange bleiben kann.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "coach_paldea_top_sp01_select_01",
      "hash64": "954258941752ACE9",
      "text": "Schön, dass Sie trotzdem hier sind!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "coach_paldea_top_sp01_select_02",
      "hash64": "954255941752A7D0",
      "text": "Sie scheinen ja echt beschäftigt zu sein.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "coach_paldea_top_sp01_01",
      "hash64": "B59269F1B0B47F2A",
      "text": "Egal, wie beschäftigt ich bin, die Einladung eines\\nChamps kann ich schlecht ablehnen.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "coach_paldea_top_sp01_02",
      "hash64": "B59268F1B0B47D77",
      "text": "Außerdem hatte ich sowieso einige Dinge zu\\nbesprechen, sowohl mit Direktor Cyano als auch\\r\\nbezüglich der Pokémon-Liga der Einall-Region.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 138,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "coach_paldea_top_sp01_03",
      "hash64": "B59267F1B0B47BC4",
      "text": "Bestimmt wird es in Zukunft auch häufiger\\nvorkommen, dass begabte Trainer dieser\\r\\nAkademie uns in Paldea besuchen, also...[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 124,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "coach_paldea_top_sp01_04",
      "hash64": "B59266F1B0B47A11",
      "text": "In Anbetracht dessen kam deine Einladung\\neigentlich gerade recht.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "coach_paldea_top_sp01_05",
      "hash64": "B59265F1B0B4785E",
      "text": "Ach ja...\\c\\nMs Brianna hat mir von deinem heldenhaften\\nEinsatz im Höhlensystem Null erzählt.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "coach_paldea_top_sp01_06",
      "hash64": "B59264F1B0B476AB",
      "text": "Aber das ist ein Gespräch, das wir an einem Ort\\nfortsetzen sollten, an dem wir von weniger\\r\\nneugierigen Augen und Ohren umgeben sind.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
